DESCRIPTION:GROCERY SHOPPING LIST\n==================================================\n\n• Beef: 350 gram\n• Celery: 5 stalk\n• Chicken Thighs: 5 unit\n• Chili Pepper: 2 unit\n• Chinese Eggplants: 2 unit\n• Chopped Whole Chicken: 500 g\n• Corn Flour: 50 g\n• Egg: 2 unit\n• Flour: 50 g\n• Garlic: 3 unit\n• Ginger: 5 slice\n• Green Onion: 1 unit\n• Green Onions: 3 unit\n• Green Pepper: 1 -2 unit\n• Jalapeno Pepper: 1 unit\n• Lemon: 0.5 unit\n• Mango: 1 unit\n• Olive Oil: 20 ml\n• Onion: 0.5 unit\n• Oyster Sauce: 3 tablespoon\n• Pixian Doubanjiang: 1 tablespoon\n• Salt: 1 teaspoon\n• Sesame Oil: 1.5 tablespoon\n• Shrimp: 250 gram\n• Soy Sauce: 6 tablespoon\n• Sugar: 0.5 tablespoon\n• Tomato: 1 unit\n• Tomatoes: 10 unit\n• Vegetable Oil: 3 tablespoon\n• Vinegar: 1 tablespoon\n• Warm Water: 80 g\n• Any Vegetables: as needed\n• Black Pepper: as needed\n• Ciba Chili Paste 糍粑辣椒: as needed\n• Goji Berries: as needed\n• Lemon Juice: as needed\n• Mozzarella Cheese: as needed\n• Oil: as needed\n• Parsley Flakes: as needed\n• Pepper: as needed\n• Red Dates: as needed\n• Scallions: as needed\n• Starch: as needed\n• Dried Mushrooms: Any (shiitake mushrooms\, bamboo fungus\, cordyceps flower\, tea tree mushrooms\, morels\, chanterelles\, king oyster mushrooms)\n• Garlic Powder: a hint\n• Peanuts: a handful\n\nTotal ingredients: 46
